From be22e5a5f3ea689a5509941a1629794aa3dce846 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:40:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] services: HOME Menu calls, BOSS background tasks

Calls the HOME Menu and its applets made that ended in "unimplemented":
- ns:s LaunchTitle: the HOME Menu starts the system modules at boot; they are HLE
  services (or already loaded), so this reports success. Other titles are refused.
- gsp::Lcd SetLedForceOff: success.
- ptm:play / ptm:sysm GetPlayHistory, GetPlayHistoryStart, GetPlayHistoryLength:
  an empty play history (Activity Log); ptm:sysm ClearSoftwareClosedFlag.
- http:C CreateRootCertChain, DestroyRootCertChain, RootCertChainAddDefaultCert,
  SelectRootCertChain: handles only (server certificates aren't checked).
- fs:USER ListSeeds (from the seed database), GetNumTitleTags and ListTitleTags
  (none).
- news:s SyncArrivedNotifications, am DeleteAllImportContextsFiltered,
  ac GetConnectingInfraPriority: success / 0.

BOSS, seen with Mii Plaza (online LLE off):
- StartBgImmediate runs the task like StartTask (Mii Plaza starts MIIDATA, PANEL,
  PANELLM and LEGEND this way).
- GetTaskInfo makes the task's properties the current ones, so the game reads them
  with ReceiveProperty.
- A task that is already downloading isn't started twice, also when the game
  registers it again meanwhile; tasks without a URL aren't run.
- Property sizes are compared in bytes: the certificate ID list (0x0F, three u32s)
  was reported as the wrong size and read into a 12-entry list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
